{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-3425300","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【活动】2016年台场VR体验","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"记录增田顺一体验台场限时VR ZONE的现场感受，并畅想把宝可梦带入虚拟现实。","date":"2016-05-16","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · VR ZONE","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · VR ZONE","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3425300.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160518044751id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3425300.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-3425300/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/001-46c38e9c0e.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1136,1126],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录增田顺一体验台场限时VR ZONE的现场感受，并畅想把宝可梦带入虚拟现实。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">去了一趟！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">台场DiverCity内</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">限时开放的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">VR ZONE</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Project i Can</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">万代南梦宫娱乐</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">的各位</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">邀请了我！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/001-46c38e9c0e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/001-46c38e9c0e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1126\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">（从左起是万代南梦宫娱乐的鸭志田先生\n\n最喜欢宝可梦的大石先生\n\n一直以来也在《宝可拳》中承蒙关照的新藤先生！\n\n谢谢你们！）\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n            VR是\n虚拟现实的简称\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/002-607cbd5cd2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/002-607cbd5cd2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n戴上这个之后……\n无论朝向哪里\n都会映出那个方向的画面！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n先从不恐怖的项目开始（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n可以享受驾驶山手线的\n《Train Meister》\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n出发！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/003-01940190ac.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/003-01940190ac.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n前进！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好开心！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n上下左右无论看向哪里\n都有画面\n真的就像是在驾驶一样！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n从新桥前往东京站！\n\n<br>\n\n\n情绪一下子高涨起来了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n于是\n还有《宝可拳》的原田先生\n负责原案与监修的\n《阿盖尔转换》\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n机器人的驾驶\n是男人的浪漫啊！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/004-2104133997.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/004-2104133997.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n糟了……\n实在太好玩了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n于是机器人的导航员\n就是这个女孩子！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/005-c9670caad9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/005-c9670caad9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"666\" height=\"673\"></a></figure> \n\n<br>\n\n\n非常可爱\n演出也很棒！\n让人心跳加速！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n于是……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n虽然我不太想玩这个……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n为了学习……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/006-21dd25453d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/006-21dd25453d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"361\" height=\"640\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n光是戴上的过程中就充满了不安（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n乘电梯\n前往高层\n（画面）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n于是电梯门打开后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n从高层大楼的屋顶\n伸出了一块木板！\n（画面）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n低头一看\n远处才看得到地面……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                    「呀——」\n太恐怖了……\n\n                    到底有多高啊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                    面对那块木板\n                \n一步都迈不出去……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n糟了……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n走不了……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/007-0bd9366c86.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/007-0bd9366c86.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n蹲着移动（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n木板尽头的小猫咪，救出！\n（画面里是小猫咪）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n虽然我当然知道这个地方是木板\n也看到了木板\n但还是走不过去（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n光靠画面\n竟然就能让\n心情和\n情感产生这么大的波动……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n真是的——\n学到了超级多东西！\n也受到了很大的刺激！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦这边\n要是也能做出些什么\n感觉会很有意思\n我来想想看（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n啊\n要是看向自己\n发现自己变成了\n喷火龙，会怎么样呢（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n吹气的话\n还会喷出火焰（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n手变成翅膀\n交叉成叉形来防御什么的（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n变成喷火龙\n在皮卡丘的森林里\n和超梦战斗！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n想法一下子就膨胀起来了呢（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附赠）\n\n<br>\n\n\n增田因为太害怕了，没能乘坐……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n喜欢这类的人还可以体验恐怖项目！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"https://project-ican.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">VR ZONE</a>\n\n↑\n详情请看这里！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">行ってきました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">台場のダイバーシティ内で</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">期間限定オープンの</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">VR ZONE</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">Project i Can</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">バンダイナムコエンターテインメント</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">さんに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ご招待頂きました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/001-46c38e9c0e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/001-46c38e9c0e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1126\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">（左からバンダイナムコエンターテインメントの鴨志田さん\n\nポケモン大好き大石さん\n\nポッ拳でもお世話になっている新藤さん！\n\nありがとうございました！）\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n            VRとは\nバーチャルリアリティの略\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/002-607cbd5cd2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/002-607cbd5cd2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれ付けると・・・\nどこを向いても\nその方向の映像が映ります！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nまずは怖くないものから（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n山手線の運転が楽しめる\n「トレイン マイスター」\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n出発！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/003-01940190ac.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/003-01940190ac.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n進行！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n楽しい！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n上下左右どこを見ても\n映像があって\n本当に運転しているみたい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n新橋から東京駅へ！\n\n<br>\n\n\nかなりテンション上がります！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\nポッ拳の原田さんが\n原案・監修の\n「アーガイル シフト」\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nロボットの操縦は\n男の浪漫です！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/004-2104133997.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/004-2104133997.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\nやばい・・・\n楽しすぎる！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそしてロボットのナビゲーターは\nこの女の子！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/005-c9670caad9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/005-c9670caad9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"666\" height=\"673\"></a></figure> \n\n<br>\n\n\nかなり可愛くて\n演出も素晴らしい！\nドキドキさせてくれます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nあんまり\nやりたくなかったけど・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n勉強のためにも・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/006-21dd25453d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/006-21dd25453d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"361\" height=\"640\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n装着中も不安でいっぱい（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nエレベーターで\n高層階へ\n（映像）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそしてエレベーターの扉が開くと・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n高層ビルの屋上から\n突き出た一枚の板！\n（映像）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n下を見ると\n遠くの方に地面が・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                    「ぎゃー」\n怖すぎる・・・\n\n                    どんだけ高層やねん！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                    板への\n                \n一歩が踏み出せない・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nやばい・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n歩けない・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/007-0bd9366c86.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3425300/007-0bd9366c86.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nしゃがんで移動（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n板の先端にいる子猫救出！\n（映像は子猫）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこの場所はもちろん\n板を見て知っていたのに\n歩けなかった（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n映像だけで\nここまで\n気持ちや\n感情が動くとは・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいやー\nむちゃむちゃ勉強になりました！\n刺激を受けました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nポケモンでも\n何か出来ると楽しそうなので\n何か考えてみます（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nあ\n自分を見たら\nリザードンに\nなってるのはどうだろう（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n息を吹くと\n炎が出たり（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n手は翼で\nバッテンにしてガードとか（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nリザードンになって\nピカチュウの森で\nミュウツーと戦う！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nアイディア膨らみますね（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n\n<br>\n\n\nマスダは怖すぎて乗れなかったけど・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n好きな方にはホラーものも！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"https://project-ican.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">VR ZONE</a>\n\n↑\n詳しくはこちらから！</div>"}}